During testing while authenticated as the low-privileged Info-User, navigating to the NTP Statistics Client List revealed a dashboard exposing over 63,000 internal client IP addresses (e.g., 16.1.32.54, 16.6.10.141) and daily request volumes exceeding 7.2 million. Furthermore, the interface provided a dropdown menu and a "Show" button to view and potentially download raw historical client counter logs, providing a complete map of the internal network without any authorization barriers.
